<title>USA: CBOE says having trouble disseminating some prices.</title>
<headline>CBOE says having trouble disseminating some prices.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Friday it was having trouble disseminating certain price data.</p>
<p>&quot;The CBOE is experiencing intermittent problems in disseminating last sale for options series with fractional strike prices,&quot; the exchange said.</p>
<p>A CBOE official said no further details were available.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk 312 408 8750))</p>
